            <title>Version 2.1.22</title>
            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                <h1 id="v2122">v2.1.22</h1>

<h3 id="features">🚀 Features</h3>

<ul>
  <li>allow selecting all search results (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/b6468570aed2a039ba5dd7081651c05516432d4f">b646857</a>)</li>
  <li>compare items using the [Option]+[Enter] key combination (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/4387b6199531adcfc7171940d4372d58ff262fd2">4387b61</a>)</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="bug-fixes">🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>

<ul>
  <li>move focus on last use panel when console hides (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/791c88c80a6704dc3f668577126970e8aec77b79">791c88c</a>)</li>
  <li>move focus to next/prev panel with TAB is pressed (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/5f226a075ffc0b302d5e3028d014a4ea18b07dfc">5f226a0</a>)</li>
  <li>hide stale divider knob (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/034865829a962eeec185f0f3f62de6df5626491a">0348658</a>)</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="refactoring">♻️ Refactoring</h3>

<ul>
  <li>merge ‘Compare Files’ and ‘Compare Folders’ menus, add ‘Compare’ toolbar icon (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/539373498384934b48e0f772c4b9a23caa251eb5">5393734</a>)</li>
</ul>

                ]]>
